From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:30:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): release unused move cache and separate viewport
 glyphs

Release cached facets when no handle mode can use the selected part.
Keep Rotate cache reuse. Split glyph drawing and distinguish Move from Pan.
Record the shell and formatting decisions.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Fixes #2508
